00:06:04.256 --> 00:06:05.250
I need the milk.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:06.256
(coughing)

00:06:06.256 --> 00:06:07.252
Than you everyone for
watching this Buzzfeed video

00:06:07.252 --> 00:06:09.138
