00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.783
Oh, I feel it.

00:06:15.783 --> 00:06:18.366
(Aria yelling)

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.643
My throat!

00:06:24.424 --> 00:06:25.593
- [Devy] Oh God, Aria.

00:06:25.593 --> 00:06:27.343
