00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:35.800
- I think if I had to
experience a mukbang,

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.863
that was the way to do it, all in.

00:06:42.604 --> 00:06:43.868
You have any final thoughts about mukbang

00:06:43.868 --> 00:06:45.126
you'd like to share?

00:06:45.126 --> 00:06:48.280
- Mukbang isn't all about
eating in front of the camera,

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:52.910
it's having fun and meeting new friends.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:57.560
That was one of the craziest
most fun experience of my life

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:01.220
and I'm so happy that mukbang
can bring people together.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:02.850
I just wanna keep doing it

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:04.790
and I wanna thank all of my Hyunee-bees

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:07.030
